<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, You view her so highly, the church Your dear bride.</l><l>What great love.</l><l>You paid such a high price, a great sacrifice</l><l>Your own blood.</l><l>You chose…</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>It is worth it today to, give all that I have</l><l>For the church.</l><l>I now see the value, and pay such a price</l><l>For this pearl.</l><l>I choose…</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now we’re home in the oyster, oh, what an enjoyment</l><l>To stay here!</l><l>His life flows around us, He’s making us precious</l><l>He’s so near.</l><l>We are…</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
